    "id": "e0192b9b90eb101e",
    "title": "3 takeaways from stress test changes and a new SVB review",
    "summary": "Fed Vice Chair for Supervision Michelle Bowman outlined three potential changes to stress-test calculations and an assessment of the central bank’s performance amid the 2023 collapse of Silicon Valley Bank.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.bankingdive.com/news/fed-michelle-bowman-stress-test-changes-svb-failure-review/830794/",
    "source": "Banking Dive",
    "tags": [
      "Michelle Bowman",
      "Federal Reserve",
      "Silicon Valley Bank",
      "United States"
    ],
